## 590. 无有限递推

```lean
theorem infiniteSupport_moments_no_finite_recurrence
    (μ : Measure ℝ)
    [IsFiniteMeasure μ]
    (hSupport : Set.Infinite μ.support) :
    ¬ ∃ d coefficients,
      ∀ n,
        moment μ (n + d) =
          ∑ j : Fin d,
            coefficients j *
              moment μ (n + j)
```

